---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const headshotUrl = "/eric%202026%20headshot.png";
---

<Base title="About - Eric">
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="page-container-narrow">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-start">
        <img
          src={headshotUrl}
          alt="Eric Martin"
          width="400"
          height="500"
          class="mx-auto aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-[200px] shrink-0 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-panel object-cover shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(15,23,42,0.1)] sm:mx-0 sm:max-w-[220px]"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-2">RevOps / strategic operations / managed workflow systems</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-ink">About</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted">
            My work sits where revenue motion, workflow design, and execution discipline
            meet. I build systems around the leaks: prospects not researched, quotes not
            followed up, CRM rows with no next step, field updates missed, and reporting
            rebuilt by hand.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
            Outside of work, I have been with my fiancee for over five years, we have a two-year-old son, two dogs, a cat, and a ferret. I spend my time making and playing music, running, and being with my family.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="surface p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How I work</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-muted">
            <li>Start from the signal flow, not the buzzword</li>
            <li>Make ownership and handoffs explicit</li>
            <li>Build for the operators, not just the presentation</li>
            <li>Keep useful review points where judgment still matters</li>
            <li>Stay close through rollout and adoption</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="surface p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">What I value</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-muted">
            <li>Clarity over complexity</li>
            <li>Execution over theater</li>
            <li>Durable systems over quick fixes</li>
            <li>Ownership over handoffs</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="surface-muted mt-8 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Where I fit</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
          Operator-led teams that need customer acquisition, revenue recovery, field
          reality, and owner visibility to line up. Places where someone has to build
          the queue, not just name the problem.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
